From c7af2bfd5a041934747840182cebc90f74979f8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 07:41:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] vpn-ui: unclip peer-row edit toggle + center the three-dots
 glyph

Field report 2026-08-04 (WireGuard VPN client peer list, follow-up to the
v1.8.9 icon-recolor fix which addressed the red-rectangle glyphs but not the
row layout):

- The "..." edit toggle (.detail_icon) was pinned to the top-right corner of
  its circle (right:1px/top:-2px), reading as cramped/off-center against the
  red delete/export buttons. Now flex-centered inside the circle with a wider
  gap to the action buttons (margin-right 10px -> 16px, active state too).
- The action cluster (.client_contorl_bg) sat at right:0, so the toggle in the
  closed state and the rightmost action button when the drawer opens were flush
  against the row's overflow:hidden edge and clipped off the viewport. Inset 8px
  so both stay on-screen.

Shared VPN peer-row CSS (vpns.css), so OpenVPN / WireGuard / PPTP / IPSec peer
lists all benefit. Layout-only; ASCII-clean (pre-existing BOM untouched);
metal-eval owed. Rides the v2.1.3 rung.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../www/sysdep/FUNCTION/VPNS_V2/VPN/vpns.css  | 22 +++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/release/src/router/www/sysdep/FUNCTION/VPNS_V2/VPN/vpns.css b/release/src/router/www/sysdep/FUNCTION/VPNS_V2/VPN/vpns.css
index 22376f7664..4f3d500d23 100644
--- a/release/src/router/www/sysdep/FUNCTION/VPNS_V2/VPN/vpns.css
+++ b/release/src/router/www/sysdep/FUNCTION/VPNS_V2/VPN/vpns.css
@@ -370,7 +370,10 @@
 }
 .client_content_bg .client_contorl_bg{
 	width: auto;
-	right: 0;
+	/* reaper: 8px inset (was right:0) so the toggle in the closed state and the
+	   rightmost action button when the drawer is open are not flush against the
+	   row's overflow:hidden edge, which clipped them off the viewport. */
+	right: 8px;
 	top: -1px;
 	position: absolute;
 }
@@ -408,6 +411,10 @@
 	letter-spacing: 1.54px;
 	margin-left: 50px;
 }
+/* reaper: center the "..." glyph inside the circle (was pinned to the top-right
+   corner via right:1px/top:-2px, so it read as cramped/off) and give the toggle
+   more breathing room from the red action buttons (10px -> 16px). Field report
+   2026-08-04 (WireGuard peer list). */
 .client_content_bg .detail_icon{
 	width: 20px;
 	height: 20px;
@@ -416,18 +423,19 @@
 	color: #EFF6FF;
 	opacity: 0.6;
 	cursor: pointer;
-	margin-right: 10px;
+	margin-right: 16px;
 	position: relative;
+	display: flex;
+	align-items: center;
+	justify-content: center;
 }
 .client_content_bg .detail_icon:before{
-	position: absolute;
 	content: "...";
-	right: 1px;
-	top: -2px;
 	letter-spacing: 1px;
 	font-weight: 700;
 	font-size: 16px;
-	line-height: 100%;
+	line-height: 0;
+	margin-top: -5px;
 }
 .client_content_bg .detail_icon:hover{
 	opacity: 1;
@@ -435,7 +443,7 @@
 .client_content_bg .detail_icon.active{
 	border: 2px solid rgb(0, 145, 255);
 	color: rgb(0, 145, 255);
-	margin-right: 10px;
+	margin-right: 16px;
 }
 .client_content_bg .client_contorl_bg > div{
 	cursor: pointer;
-- 
2.25.1

